  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### Could you please suggest that how can I use the Net to Gross calculations in the payroll?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 28 Apr, 2021 at 11:54 AM\n\n\t\tUse the Net to Gross Calculator from the Manage Payroll>> Process Payroll>> Record Gross Pay section.\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nPlease note that the status needs to be pending of the client. \n - Net to gross will work only for the employees who are on variable pay\n\nOnce a desired net pay is entered in the box, the gross pay will be calculated \n\nOnce the save button is pressed the updated gross pay will be reflected in the payroll\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188558\">Payroll FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Could you please suggest that how can I use the Net to Gross calculations in the payroll?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 28 Apr, 2021 at 11:54 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Use the Net to Gross Calculator from the Manage Payroll&gt;&gt; Process Payroll&gt;&gt; Record Gross Pay section.<br><br>Please refer below screenshot for more help.<br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074215186/original/FsxOy-Rwi7ULCwtCheREQ7cKOv5Rx-99tg.png?1553597324\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074215186/original/FsxOy-Rwi7ULCwtCheREQ7cKOv5Rx-99tg.png?1553597324\" data-fileid=\"9074215186\" data-uniquekey=\"1553597315764\"></p><p><br></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please note that the status needs to be pending of the client. </span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Net to gross will work only for the employees who are on variable pay</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once a desired net pay is entered in the box, the gross pay will be calculated <img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9128257960/original/TbJEnUFxJ0Thj7APgq6V4ur85JzDjL2U7w.png?1619607184\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9128257960\"></span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once the save button is pressed the updated gross pay will be reflected in the payroll</span></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165681\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165681/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165681\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165681/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165681\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with